@startuml 02-seguridad-secuencia
' Diagrama de secuencia - Autenticacion JWT y autorizacion por rol
' Referencias:
'   ms-*/src/main/java/co/analisys/*/config/SecurityConfig.java:L21-L43
'   ms-*/src/main/java/co/analisys/*/config/KeycloakRealmRoleConverter.java:L14-L25
'   ms-*/src/main/resources/application.properties (issuer-uri, jwk-set-uri)
'   keycloak/full-export/gimnasio-realm.json:L3, L5 (RS256), L8 (accessTokenLifespan=300)
'   ms-membresias/.../controller/MiembroController.java:L38
'   ms-programacion/.../config/RestClientConfig.java:L22-L33 (reenvio del JWT)
' Filtros y manejadores: los que Spring Security 6 registra por defecto con
' oauth2ResourceServer().jwt(); el proyecto no define manejadores propios de 401/403.

title Seguridad JWT - ejemplo GET /api/miembros (ms-membresias)

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC

participant "Postman" as C
participant "Keycloak\nrealm gimnasio" as K
box "ms-membresias :8081" #F4FFF0
  participant "BearerToken\nAuthenticationFilter" as F
  participant "JwtAuthenticationProvider\n(NimbusJwtDecoder +\nKeycloakRealmRoleConverter)" as D
  participant "AuthorizationFilter /\n@PreAuthorize" as A
  participant "MiembroController" as MC
end box

== Login ==
C -> K : POST /protocol/openid-connect/token\n(password grant, client *-service)
K --> C : access_token RS256 (exp 300 s,\nrealm_access.roles, iss localhost:8080)

== Token valido y rol suficiente -> 200 ==
C -> F : Bearer <JWT trainer1>
F -> D : authenticate
D -> K : GET /certs (JWKS, en cache)
D -> D : firma, exp, iss; realm_access.roles -> ROLE_TRAINER
D --> F : autenticado
F -> A : hasAnyRole('ROLE_ADMIN','ROLE_TRAINER')
A -> MC : obtenerTodosMiembros()
MC --> C : 200

== Sin token -> 401 ==
C -> F : sin Authorization
F -> A : peticion anonima
A --> C : 401 WWW-Authenticate: Bearer\n(ExceptionTranslationFilter -> BearerTokenAuthenticationEntryPoint)

== Token malformado, alterado o expirado -> 401 ==
C -> F : Bearer <token invalido>
F -> D : authenticate
D --> F : InvalidBearerTokenException
F --> C : 401 error="invalid_token"\n("Malformed token" | "Signed JWT rejected" | "Jwt expired at ...")

== Rol insuficiente -> 403 ==
C -> F : Bearer <JWT member1>
F -> D : authenticate
D --> F : autenticado [ROLE_MEMBER]
F -> A : hasAnyRole('ROLE_ADMIN','ROLE_TRAINER')
A --> C : 403 error="insufficient_scope"\n(BearerTokenAccessDeniedHandler)

note over C, MC
  ms-programacion reenvia el mismo header Authorization a ms-personal
  (RestClientConfig.java:L22-L33); ms-personal repite la misma validacion.
end note

@enduml
